                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b26ffecf-3c34-3b01-a2a9-48e5e71b81a8",
                                        "entry_id": "ad9145eb-e7ef-3b6a-8e87-1a1e19349b63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A woodwind instrument consisting of a tube with a row of holes that produce sound through vibrations caused by air blown across the edge of the holes, often tuned by plugging one or more holes with a finger; the Western concert flute, a transverse side-blown flute of European origin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7596fd2-9629-4ec1-9b85-5e96d2cfa6fa",
                                                "sense_id": "b26ffecf-3c34-3b01-a2a9-48e5e71b81a8",
                                                "text": "The breathing flute's ſoft notes are heard around, / And the ſhril trumpets mix their ſilver ſound; / The vaulted roofs vvith echoing muſic ring, / Theſe touch the vocal ſtops, and thoſe the trembling ſtring."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b37f0858-f05f-4c6f-b4ea-76de2929795c",
                                                "sense_id": "b26ffecf-3c34-3b01-a2a9-48e5e71b81a8",
                                                "text": "The group played huge drums placed overhead, along with flutes and a kotolike zither."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97f6e888-d3c4-43f6-b344-2b253a73a903",
                                                "sense_id": "b26ffecf-3c34-3b01-a2a9-48e5e71b81a8",
                                                "text": "After another alternation of the two elements, there is a more playful episode, in which flute and bassoon take up the first element, with swooping glissando on the ondes Martenot."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "27aa9ac4-828f-30e9-adbc-3176817afa3f",
                                        "entry_id": "ad9145eb-e7ef-3b6a-8e87-1a1e19349b63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A recorder, also a woodwind instrument."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f223fd28-5a7f-3637-ba51-621987f2feab",
                                        "entry_id": "ad9145eb-e7ef-3b6a-8e87-1a1e19349b63",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A glass with a long, narrow bowl and a long stem, used for drinking wine, especially champagne."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f30f567-222e-41ab-ba98-0538cec547e3",
                                                "sense_id": "f223fd28-5a7f-3637-ba51-621987f2feab",
                                                "text": "These are champagne glasses, says Peggy.\nNo, I mean the tall ones, Jamie says.\nYou're thinking of flutes, says Peggy. These are coupes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5068c873-da76-3193-808a-0ea7b158c68a",
